# ============================================
# Project Build Artifacts
# ============================================
# Use builds/* (not builds/) so we can re-include specific subdirs below.
# Git cannot re-include files under a parent directory that is itself ignored.
builds/*
# Squire (autonomous SOC agent) is tracked. Other builds/ subdirs (client
# work, interview take-homes, student projects) stay ignored by default.
!builds/squire/
builds/squire/.venv/
builds/squire/.ruff_cache/
builds/squire/.pytest_cache/
builds/squire/**/__pycache__/
builds/squire/src/squire.egg-info/
builds/squire/.coverage
builds/squire/htmlcov/
.skills-staging/
.claude/
get-shit-done/
# .planning/ stays ignored. Contains operational STATE, internal session
# notes, and at least one real Bearer token in 18-RESEARCH.md. Move
# selectively to tracked locations after sanitization.
.planning/
1password-vault-reference.md
notes-golden-file-*.txt

